1
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:14,431
‎CABARAN

2
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:21,604
<i>‎Ranma dari Sekolah Seni Bela Diri
‎Semuanya Boleh Saotome.</i>

3
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,857
<i>‎Akane dari Dojo Tendo.</i>

4
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:27,610
<i>‎Mereka berdua kini sudah bertunang
‎atas keputusan ayah mereka.</i>

5
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:29,571
<i>‎Tak perlu cari calon untuk saya.</i>

6
00:00:29,654 --> 00:00:31,072
<i>‎Menyusahkan saja.</i>

7
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:34,284
<i>‎Ranma ada satu masalah.</i>

8
00:00:35,368 --> 00:00:36,536
<i>‎Awak buat apa?</i>

9
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:40,290
<i>‎Dia bertukar menjadi perempuan
‎apabila disimbah air.</i>

10
00:00:40,373 --> 00:00:41,958
‎HODOH

11
00:00:44,002 --> 00:00:47,964
‎RANMA1/2

12
00:02:12,882 --> 00:02:17,095
{\an8}‎TSUBASA KURENAI PECAH TEMBELANG!

13
00:02:21,015 --> 00:02:24,519
‎"Tak lama lagi,
‎aku datang ambil nyawa kau."

14
00:02:24,602 --> 00:02:26,479
‎Tsubasa Kurenai?

15
00:02:27,063 --> 00:02:28,398
‎Dapat cabaran lagi?

16
00:02:32,527 --> 00:02:35,029
‎Siapa Tsubasa Kurenai yang aku kenal?

17
00:02:35,697 --> 00:02:38,408
‎Apa kau buat? Mencuri?
‎Makan tak bayar? Penipuan kahwin?

18
00:02:38,491 --> 00:02:39,492
‎Mulut kau.

19
00:02:39,576 --> 00:02:42,162
‎Bersedialah, Ranma Saotome!

20
00:02:54,799 --> 00:02:57,218
‎- Peti…
‎- Surat?

21
00:02:58,678 --> 00:03:00,179
{\an8}‎POS

22
00:03:02,765 --> 00:03:05,143
‎Serang!

23
00:03:09,981 --> 00:03:12,233
‎- Apa hal?
‎- Ranma.

24
00:03:12,317 --> 00:03:14,694
‎Kau buat apa dengan peti surat?

25
00:03:14,777 --> 00:03:17,155
‎Aku tak buat salah dengan peti surat pun!

26
00:03:17,906 --> 00:03:20,575
‎Serang!

27
00:03:50,939 --> 00:03:52,106
‎Perempuan?

28
00:03:53,650 --> 00:03:55,068
‎Ranma…

29
00:03:59,572 --> 00:04:02,575
‎Serang…

30
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:08,915
‎Siapa dia?

31
00:04:12,418 --> 00:04:17,340
‎- Entah.
‎- Dia bukan salah seorang tunang kau?

32
00:04:17,423 --> 00:04:19,842
‎Apa kau buat di tengah jalan?

33
00:04:19,926 --> 00:04:21,135
‎Ukyo.

34
00:04:23,513 --> 00:04:25,306
‎Ukyo…

35
00:04:27,308 --> 00:04:29,477
‎Tsubasa… Kurenai…

36
00:04:31,854 --> 00:04:33,064
‎CABARAN

37
00:04:33,147 --> 00:04:35,149
<i>‎Orang yang hantar cabaran itu.</i>

38
00:04:35,233 --> 00:04:37,235
‎Kau kenal dia?

39
00:04:37,318 --> 00:04:40,947
‎Buang dia.
‎Ke dalam tong sampah. Selamat jalan!

40
00:04:43,449 --> 00:04:46,744
‎Aduh. Aku tak sangka
‎Tsubasa kejar aku sampai ke sini.

41
00:04:46,828 --> 00:04:48,329
‎Siapa dia sebenarnya?

42
00:04:50,248 --> 00:04:53,584
‎Tsubasa budak kelas sekolah aku dulu.

43
00:04:53,668 --> 00:04:54,752
‎Jadi, kenapa dia…

44
00:04:54,836 --> 00:04:56,921
‎Kenapa dia nak lawan aku?

45
00:04:57,005 --> 00:04:59,590
‎Jangan lupa,
‎dulu aku menyamar jadi lelaki.

46
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:01,592
<i>‎Jadi…</i>

47
00:05:01,676 --> 00:05:02,885
‎Ukyo.

48
00:05:03,678 --> 00:05:04,679
‎Suka.

49
00:05:04,762 --> 00:05:08,599
‎Tsubasa. Berat hati aku
‎nak cakap begini, tapi…

50
00:05:08,683 --> 00:05:12,145
‎aku dah bertunang.

51
00:05:12,854 --> 00:05:16,274
<i>‎Aku dah bertunang.</i>

52
00:05:16,357 --> 00:05:19,694
<i>‎Bertunang…</i>

53
00:05:22,613 --> 00:05:25,408
‎Tapi, Tsubasa tak berputus asa.

54
00:05:25,491 --> 00:05:27,869
‎Walaupun selepas Ukyo pindah sekolah,

55
00:05:28,453 --> 00:05:31,873
‎saya kirim banyak surat cinta kepada Ukyo.

56
00:05:31,956 --> 00:05:34,834
‎Kau memang kental.

57
00:05:34,917 --> 00:05:36,085
‎INI TUNANG COMEL AKU

58
00:05:36,169 --> 00:05:38,838
‎Jadi, aku hantar surat minta putus
‎dengan gambar Ranma.

59
00:05:38,921 --> 00:05:41,174
‎Sedihnya…

60
00:05:41,924 --> 00:05:44,093
‎Kau hantar gambar Ranma yang mana?

61
00:05:44,177 --> 00:05:46,929
‎- Mestilah gambar perempuan.
‎- Kenapa?

62
00:05:47,013 --> 00:05:51,350
‎Tsubasa ingat aku lelaki. Pelik pula
‎kalau aku bertunang dengan lelaki.

63
00:05:57,607 --> 00:05:59,275
‎Apa?

64
00:05:59,358 --> 00:06:00,359
‎Hodoh.

65
00:06:00,443 --> 00:06:03,321
<i>‎Hodoh…</i>

66
00:06:03,946 --> 00:06:05,823
‎Hei, Ranma?

67
00:06:06,657 --> 00:06:08,576
‎Jangan kata kau terasa?

68
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,579
‎Ukyo!

69
00:06:13,164 --> 00:06:16,250
‎Siapa kalah dengan perempuan hodoh ini?

70
00:06:18,336 --> 00:06:20,129
‎Apa boleh buat?

71
00:06:20,213 --> 00:06:22,131
‎Sudahlah. Balik sajalah.

72
00:06:22,215 --> 00:06:23,800
‎Kau tengoklah nanti!

73
00:06:26,469 --> 00:06:27,845
‎Kau tak rasa dah melampaukah?

74
00:06:27,929 --> 00:06:30,640
‎Tak apa. Baru dia sedar sikit.

75
00:06:31,599 --> 00:06:34,894
‎Serang!

76
00:06:42,902 --> 00:06:44,570
‎Aduh. Gagal.

77
00:06:44,654 --> 00:06:48,282
‎Tsubasa…

78
00:06:48,366 --> 00:06:51,202
‎Aku nak masak kau!

79
00:06:51,828 --> 00:06:55,123
‎Tunggu. Tsubasa, tengok.

80
00:06:56,999 --> 00:06:58,376
‎Kau buat apa?

81
00:06:59,127 --> 00:07:02,380
‎Nampak tak? Ukyo perempuan.

82
00:07:02,463 --> 00:07:04,298
‎Perempuan.

83
00:07:06,592 --> 00:07:07,593
‎MASALAH SELESAI

84
00:07:07,677 --> 00:07:09,929
‎Kenapa tak cakap dari awal saja?

85
00:07:10,012 --> 00:07:11,097
‎Betul juga.

86
00:07:12,098 --> 00:07:14,517
‎Sebenarnya saya dah lama tahu

87
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,436
‎Ukyo itu perempuan.

88
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:22,900
‎Faham tak? Saya cuma suka perempuan.

89
00:07:23,526 --> 00:07:26,195
‎Saya akan rampas Ukyo daripada awak.

90
00:07:29,782 --> 00:07:30,908
‎Hodoh.

91
00:07:30,992 --> 00:07:31,993
‎MASALAH BELUM SELESAI

92
00:07:32,076 --> 00:07:34,287
‎Tsubasa suka perempuan?

93
00:07:34,787 --> 00:07:36,414
‎Takutnya.

94
00:07:36,497 --> 00:07:40,168
‎Berani kau…

95
00:07:42,587 --> 00:07:44,547
‎- Pagi.
‎- Pagi.

96
00:07:45,381 --> 00:07:48,301
‎Serang!

97
00:07:50,094 --> 00:07:52,263
‎Kejamnya awak, Ukyo.

98
00:07:54,098 --> 00:07:55,725
‎Comelnya!

99
00:07:55,808 --> 00:07:59,103
‎Aku dah kata,
‎jangan ikut aku ke mana-mana, Tsubasa.

100
00:08:00,938 --> 00:08:02,190
‎Itu Tsubasa Kurenai.

101
00:08:02,273 --> 00:08:05,943
‎Kau tak faham lagi?
‎Aku dah ada tunang. Nama dia Ranma.

102
00:08:06,027 --> 00:08:09,780
‎Perempuan hodoh itu?
‎Dia tak boleh jadi tunang awak.

103
00:08:09,864 --> 00:08:12,366
‎Hei, Ranma itu lelaki…

104
00:08:12,450 --> 00:08:14,660
‎Pagi, Tsubasa.

105
00:08:14,744 --> 00:08:16,412
‎Perempuan hodoh!

106
00:08:16,496 --> 00:08:18,247
‎Kau nak apa, perempuan bodoh?

107
00:08:20,917 --> 00:08:23,628
‎Jom kita bertarung untuk tengok

108
00:08:23,711 --> 00:08:25,546
‎siapa lebih layak untuk Ukyo.

109
00:08:26,297 --> 00:08:27,465
‎Apa ini?

110
00:08:27,548 --> 00:08:29,300
‎Apa? Waktu rehat…

111
00:08:29,383 --> 00:08:30,676
‎Warung <i>‎okonomiyaki?</i>

112
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,970
‎- Warung?
‎- Apa ini?

113
00:08:33,054 --> 00:08:34,055
‎WARUNG OKONOMIYAKI UCCHAN

114
00:08:34,138 --> 00:08:36,557
‎Siapa jual paling banyak,
‎dia menang. Berani?

115
00:08:36,641 --> 00:08:37,934
‎Macam seronok saja.

116
00:08:38,768 --> 00:08:41,020
‎Berani kau buat iklan tak tanya aku?

117
00:08:41,562 --> 00:08:43,147
‎Untung besar aku.

118
00:08:43,231 --> 00:08:45,149
‎Untung tak jadi tunang saya?

119
00:08:46,526 --> 00:08:49,403
‎Hore! Waktu rehat!

120
00:08:49,987 --> 00:08:52,073
‎Lama tidak bersua, semua.

121
00:08:52,156 --> 00:08:56,536
‎Ini Kelab Penyiaran Sekolah Tinggi
‎Furinkan. Semua orang, mari tengok.

122
00:08:56,619 --> 00:08:57,620
‎WARUNG UCCHAN
‎TSUBASA - RANMA

123
00:08:57,703 --> 00:09:01,374
‎Acara mengejut Sekolah Furinkan ini
‎ialah pertarungan perut dan jiwa.

124
00:09:01,457 --> 00:09:04,502
‎Inilah pertandingan jualan <i>‎okonomiyaki</i>
‎dengan warung Ucchan.

125
00:09:04,585 --> 00:09:08,506
‎Pengulas anda,
‎Ichiro dari Kelab Penyiaran Furinkan.

126
00:09:08,589 --> 00:09:13,010
‎Bertanding untuk merebut
‎cinta Ukyo Kuonji, mereka berdua.

127
00:09:13,678 --> 00:09:17,515
‎Budak nakal Sekolah Tinggi Furinkan,
‎Ranma Saotome.

128
00:09:17,598 --> 00:09:19,600
‎Kalau kalah, jangan menangis.

129
00:09:19,684 --> 00:09:22,395
‎Serta raksasa cinta menyerang yang kental,

130
00:09:22,478 --> 00:09:24,397
‎Tsubasa Kurenai!

131
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:26,607
‎Jangan harap aku kalah dengan kau, hodoh!

132
00:09:27,608 --> 00:09:29,026
‎Peraturannya satu saja.

133
00:09:29,110 --> 00:09:32,488
‎Siapa jual paling banyak
<i>‎okonomiyaki,</i>‎ dia menang.

134
00:09:32,572 --> 00:09:35,950
‎Ujian cinta dan jiwa terunggul.
‎Jangan tunggu. Dah nak habis.

135
00:09:36,033 --> 00:09:39,620
‎Ini dia Pakar Pemanggang,
‎yang mencetuskan pertandingan ini.

136
00:09:39,704 --> 00:09:43,457
‎Ukyo Kuonji akan memberi isyarat
‎untuk memulakan pertandingan hangat ini.

137
00:09:43,541 --> 00:09:46,377
‎Warung Okonomiyaki Ucchan
‎Sekolah Tinggi Furinkan

138
00:09:46,460 --> 00:09:47,795
‎kini dibuka!

139
00:09:47,878 --> 00:09:49,547
‎Aku takkan kalah dengan dia.

140
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:51,257
‎Serang!

141
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:53,718
{\an8}‎Jual banyak-banyak, okey?

142
00:09:53,801 --> 00:09:57,054
‎Aku dengar Tsubasa cuma suka perempuan.

143
00:09:57,138 --> 00:09:58,973
‎Sebab itu dia suka Ukyo?

144
00:09:59,056 --> 00:10:01,976
<i>‎Kenapa Ranma serius sangat?</i>

145
00:10:02,768 --> 00:10:06,731
<i>‎Aku nak jual semuanya dengan rupa aku.
‎Baru dia dah tak cakap aku hodoh.</i>

146
00:10:06,814 --> 00:10:08,899
‎Medan tempur mereka, waktu rehat.

147
00:10:08,983 --> 00:10:10,651
‎Diumpan dengan bau sos,

148
00:10:10,735 --> 00:10:13,988
‎murid lelaki kini bergegas
‎untuk membeli makanan dan cinta!

149
00:10:14,071 --> 00:10:16,365
‎- Aku nak <i>‎okonomiyaki.</i>
‎- Aku pun nak.

150
00:10:16,449 --> 00:10:17,742
‎Selamat datang!

151
00:10:17,825 --> 00:10:19,827
‎Nak beli daripada adik comel?

152
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:23,331
‎Semarak cinta! Perjuangan maruah!

153
00:10:23,414 --> 00:10:26,375
‎Siapa akan senyum akhir sekali?

154
00:10:36,302 --> 00:10:39,889
‎KIta ada pemenang!
‎Tsubasa Kurenai menang besar!

155
00:10:39,972 --> 00:10:41,766
‎Habis dijual. Cintanya tiada tandingan.

156
00:10:41,849 --> 00:10:46,145
‎Mengejutkan, <i>‎okonomiyaki</i>
‎Ranma Saotome langsung tak terjual!

157
00:10:46,228 --> 00:10:47,688
‎Biar betul…

158
00:10:47,772 --> 00:10:50,358
‎Dah sah. Awak hodoh.

159
00:10:50,441 --> 00:10:52,693
‎Sekarang, Ukyo milik saya.

160
00:10:52,777 --> 00:10:54,445
‎Padan muka.

161
00:10:54,528 --> 00:10:57,031
‎Tsubasa Kurenai, kami nak temu bual awak!

162
00:10:57,657 --> 00:10:59,742
‎Aku betul-betul ingat aku menang…

163
00:11:00,326 --> 00:11:02,328
‎Hodoh sangatkah aku?

164
00:11:02,411 --> 00:11:04,747
‎Awak merepek apa? Awak sangat comel.

165
00:11:04,830 --> 00:11:07,249
‎Perempuan bertocang dua! Comelnya awak!

166
00:11:07,333 --> 00:11:08,501
‎Nah!

167
00:11:10,711 --> 00:11:13,964
‎Satu-satunya orang
‎yang tak kenal diri sebenar Ranma…

168
00:11:14,048 --> 00:11:16,342
‎Tatewaki saja, bukan?

169
00:11:16,425 --> 00:11:17,426
‎Yakah?

170
00:11:17,510 --> 00:11:21,138
‎Ya. Tak mungkin kau boleh menang
‎dengan perempuan betul di sekolah ini.

171
00:11:23,516 --> 00:11:25,518
‎Aku nak bertanding betul-betul kali ini.

172
00:11:26,018 --> 00:11:27,937
‎Tunggulah!

173
00:11:32,066 --> 00:11:36,028
<i>‎Okonomiyaki</i>‎ sedap.
‎Siapa cepat, dia dapat.

174
00:11:36,112 --> 00:11:38,948
‎- Cantiknya.
‎- Kostum arnab?

175
00:11:39,031 --> 00:11:40,908
‎- Aku nak beli.
‎- Aku pun.

176
00:11:41,700 --> 00:11:43,119
{\an8}‎Terima kasih!

177
00:11:43,202 --> 00:11:45,413
{\an8}‎DIJUAL

178
00:11:45,496 --> 00:11:49,333
<i>‎Tak ada seorang pun tahu
‎aku sedang menyamar.</i>

179
00:11:50,418 --> 00:11:52,753
‎- Aku nak dua.
‎- Aku nak tiga.

180
00:11:53,295 --> 00:11:55,381
‎- Aku nak sepuluh, jom dating.
‎- Aku pun!

181
00:11:55,464 --> 00:11:56,715
‎Sukanya!

182
00:11:59,343 --> 00:12:02,638
‎Kau buat apa? Aku tinggal satu lagi.

183
00:12:02,721 --> 00:12:04,432
‎Ikut sajalah.

184
00:12:05,349 --> 00:12:06,934
‎RANMA

185
00:12:08,602 --> 00:12:11,730
‎Kenapa seronok sangat budak lelaki suka?

186
00:12:11,814 --> 00:12:14,275
‎Diam. Ini pertandingan.

187
00:12:14,358 --> 00:12:17,403
‎Siapa nak beli yang terakhir?

188
00:12:17,486 --> 00:12:18,529
‎Sudahlah!

189
00:12:19,738 --> 00:12:21,657
‎Saya dah agak. Saya menang.

190
00:12:22,616 --> 00:12:24,952
‎Sekarang, Ukyo betul-betul milik saya…

191
00:12:25,035 --> 00:12:26,036
‎Tunggu dulu.

192
00:12:32,918 --> 00:12:35,588
<i>‎Okonomiyaki</i>‎ terakhir itu. Aku nak beli,

193
00:12:37,339 --> 00:12:39,758
‎- Ucchan.
‎- Ukyo.

194
00:12:40,885 --> 00:12:42,720
‎Sekarang, pertandingan ini seri.

195
00:12:42,803 --> 00:12:46,223
‎Jahatnya. Saya dah nak menang tadi.

196
00:12:48,142 --> 00:12:51,896
‎Kalau awak tak nak sangat dengan saya,

197
00:12:51,979 --> 00:12:55,107
‎cakaplah dari awal!

198
00:12:55,191 --> 00:12:57,401
‎Aku dah cakap dari awal!

199
00:12:58,611 --> 00:13:01,739
‎Baiklah. Kita putus di sini saja.

200
00:13:02,281 --> 00:13:05,409
‎Saya akan lepaskan sepenuhnya
‎cinta saya terhadap Ukyo.

201
00:13:10,122 --> 00:13:11,207
‎Selamat tinggal!

202
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:13,375
<i>‎Tsubasa…</i>

203
00:13:16,337 --> 00:13:18,130
‎- Ranma?
‎- Ranma?

204
00:13:25,846 --> 00:13:28,766
{\an8}‎TAMAN

205
00:13:30,809 --> 00:13:31,894
‎Tsubasa.

206
00:13:33,312 --> 00:13:36,607
‎Aku tak suka cakap begini,
‎tapi kau menang pertandingan tadi.

207
00:13:37,274 --> 00:13:39,944
‎Sebenarnya, awak tak hodoh pun.

208
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:44,657
‎Awak sebenarnya cantik
‎sampai saya rasa nak buli awak.

209
00:13:45,783 --> 00:13:48,577
‎Maaf. Saya memang jahat.

210
00:13:49,870 --> 00:13:52,623
‎Sebab itu Ukyo benci saya.

211
00:13:53,332 --> 00:13:55,793
<i>‎Aku tak rasa itu sebabnya.</i>

212
00:13:57,211 --> 00:13:59,171
‎Tak apa, kau memang comel.

213
00:13:59,672 --> 00:14:01,715
‎Ada saja orang suka kau nanti.

214
00:14:04,885 --> 00:14:07,012
‎Kau fikir apa sekarang?

215
00:14:07,096 --> 00:14:09,515
‎Buah hati baru, saya rasa nak…

216
00:14:09,598 --> 00:14:11,767
‎Serang!

217
00:14:11,850 --> 00:14:15,020
‎- Tak, bukan ini!
‎- Serang!

218
00:14:15,104 --> 00:14:17,940
‎Cepat betul Tsubasa dah okey.

219
00:14:18,023 --> 00:14:20,276
‎Tsubasa cepat suka mana-mana perempuan?

220
00:14:20,359 --> 00:14:25,281
‎Tapi mesti Tsubasa patah hati
‎kalau dia tahu diri sebenar Ranma.

221
00:14:25,364 --> 00:14:28,993
‎Macam mana pun, dia tetap akan patah hati.

222
00:14:35,666 --> 00:14:37,042
‎Apa jadi?

223
00:14:37,126 --> 00:14:41,005
‎Kenapa? Macam mana? Apa hal?

224
00:14:41,797 --> 00:14:46,051
‎Serang!

225
00:14:46,135 --> 00:14:49,138
‎Jangan dekat!

226
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:02,693
‎Dia lari lagi.

227
00:15:04,153 --> 00:15:06,822
‎Walaupun saya cintakan Ranma.

228
00:15:07,865 --> 00:15:11,201
‎Kenapa awak tak suka saya?

229
00:15:11,285 --> 00:15:14,038
‎Mesti ada banyak sebab.

230
00:15:14,914 --> 00:15:16,040
‎Tsubasa.

231
00:15:19,376 --> 00:15:21,337
‎Kenapa dengan dia?

232
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:24,006
‎Tsubasa taasub bab bercinta.

233
00:15:24,089 --> 00:15:25,507
‎Ucchan.

234
00:15:25,591 --> 00:15:28,469
‎Jangan berlembut sangat.
‎Pukul dia sikit, baru sedar diri.

235
00:15:28,552 --> 00:15:31,847
<i>‎Aku tak boleh pukul perempuan.</i>

236
00:15:31,931 --> 00:15:33,974
<i>‎Aku kena cari cara lain untuk jauhkan dia.</i>

237
00:15:34,808 --> 00:15:38,354
‎Hei, kenapa awak tak lupakan saja
‎Ranma yang asyik nak lari itu?

238
00:15:38,437 --> 00:15:40,648
‎Awak tak nak suka orang lain pula?

239
00:15:40,731 --> 00:15:45,277
‎Ramai budak lelaki cakap awak comel.

240
00:15:45,361 --> 00:15:47,529
‎Tak nak, saya benci lelaki.

241
00:15:47,613 --> 00:15:49,740
‎Apa pun, eloklah awak lupakan Ranma.

242
00:15:50,324 --> 00:15:51,575
‎Kenapa?

243
00:15:51,659 --> 00:15:53,452
‎Kenapa?

244
00:15:54,411 --> 00:15:56,288
‎Jangan kata…

245
00:15:56,789 --> 00:15:59,166
‎awak suka Ranma?

246
00:15:59,875 --> 00:16:02,252
‎Siapa suka dia?

247
00:16:02,336 --> 00:16:04,672
‎Betul juga. Terkejut saya tadi.

248
00:16:04,755 --> 00:16:07,633
‎Saya cuma risaukan awak.

249
00:16:08,175 --> 00:16:09,510
‎Apa?

250
00:16:18,268 --> 00:16:20,896
‎Akane, baiknya awak.

251
00:16:21,438 --> 00:16:23,440
‎- Lepaskan.
‎- Tak nak.

252
00:16:23,524 --> 00:16:24,817
‎Lepaslah.

253
00:16:25,609 --> 00:16:26,694
‎Anak panah bersurat?

254
00:16:27,903 --> 00:16:32,992
<i>‎Kepada Tsubasa. Saya tunggu awak
‎di taman Ahad ini. Daripada Ranma.</i>

255
00:16:46,797 --> 00:16:48,424
‎Ranma yang tulis?

256
00:16:48,507 --> 00:16:52,428
‎Ya. Dia ajak Tsubasa keluar.

257
00:16:52,511 --> 00:16:56,348
‎Maknanya, Ranma suka Tsubasa?

258
00:16:56,432 --> 00:16:57,433
‎Biar betul.

259
00:16:57,516 --> 00:16:59,435
‎Tsubasa.

260
00:17:00,394 --> 00:17:01,812
‎Ranma.

261
00:17:04,815 --> 00:17:07,818
‎Hari ini, kita berkasih-kasihan.

262
00:17:11,405 --> 00:17:15,325
‎Sekarang, mari kita terjah
‎gelanggang cinta sejati bersama-sama.

263
00:17:18,912 --> 00:17:21,540
‎Ranma tak sihatkah?

264
00:17:21,623 --> 00:17:23,250
‎Siapa awak?

265
00:17:23,834 --> 00:17:27,546
‎Rakan latihan cinta.
‎Pengganti baru perempuan itu.

266
00:17:28,213 --> 00:17:30,591
‎Harmoni kita akan menggubah melodi cinta.

267
00:17:30,674 --> 00:17:32,551
‎Sekarang, mari bunyikan gong jiwa…

268
00:17:32,634 --> 00:17:35,554
‎- Gong…
‎- Dari mana kau belajar ayat geli begitu?

269
00:17:35,637 --> 00:17:37,347
‎Apa hal, Akane?

270
00:17:37,431 --> 00:17:39,808
‎Bukankah dia nak perempuan?

271
00:17:39,892 --> 00:17:43,145
‎Aku buat begini sebab
‎nak Tsubasa nampak lelaki pun bagus.

272
00:17:43,228 --> 00:17:45,022
‎Selepas itu, kau nak buat apa?

273
00:17:45,105 --> 00:17:46,899
‎Bukankah dia pikat kau juga?

274
00:17:46,982 --> 00:17:48,150
‎Hei, tunggu.

275
00:17:48,233 --> 00:17:50,444
‎Sudah, jangan masuk campur, okey?

276
00:17:50,527 --> 00:17:51,945
‎Apa?

277
00:17:52,029 --> 00:17:55,032
‎Jom, mari kita berjanji.

278
00:17:55,115 --> 00:17:56,784
‎Awak merepek apa?

279
00:17:56,867 --> 00:18:00,162
‎Perjalanan cinta kita baru saja bermula.

280
00:18:00,245 --> 00:18:02,081
‎Rimasnya. Jangan ikut.

281
00:18:02,164 --> 00:18:05,918
‎Degupan kencang bermakna ada tarikan.
‎Sekarang, mari kita berdua…

282
00:18:06,001 --> 00:18:08,670
‎Diam. Jangan bernafas. Jangan bercakap.

283
00:18:08,754 --> 00:18:10,672
‎Jangan lari, pencuri.

284
00:18:11,381 --> 00:18:14,718
‎Kucing tak guna!

285
00:18:18,138 --> 00:18:19,139
‎Miau?

286
00:18:20,682 --> 00:18:23,519
‎Kucing!

287
00:18:30,734 --> 00:18:32,361
‎- Hei.
‎- Tunggu.

288
00:18:32,986 --> 00:18:37,324
‎Sejak lahir lagi, tak pernah sekali pun…

289
00:18:37,991 --> 00:18:42,412
‎saya ada rasa

290
00:18:43,247 --> 00:18:46,875
‎nak peluk lelaki! Bodoh!

291
00:18:46,959 --> 00:18:49,086
‎Berpusing-pusing…

292
00:18:49,169 --> 00:18:51,255
‎Helo. Selamat tinggal.

293
00:18:55,884 --> 00:18:58,011
‎Benci betul dia dengan lelaki.

294
00:18:58,095 --> 00:19:02,015
‎Padan muka. Berani lelaki sentuh saya…

295
00:19:04,893 --> 00:19:06,395
‎Ranma?

296
00:19:06,478 --> 00:19:07,479
‎Ya…

297
00:19:08,772 --> 00:19:10,858
‎Siapa buat awak begini?

298
00:19:10,941 --> 00:19:12,484
‎Patutkah saya beritahu Tsubasa?

299
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,820
‎Awak perlukan rawatan.

300
00:19:14,903 --> 00:19:15,988
‎Habislah saya.

301
00:19:16,071 --> 00:19:18,907
‎Ranma, jangan cakap begitu.

302
00:19:18,991 --> 00:19:22,953
‎Saya nak mandi buat kali terakhir
‎sebelum tamat riwayat.

303
00:19:23,036 --> 00:19:24,955
‎Mandi? Baiklah.

304
00:19:25,038 --> 00:19:27,332
‎DOJO TENDO

305
00:19:30,878 --> 00:19:33,630
‎Sedapnya mandi petang.

306
00:19:37,301 --> 00:19:38,760
‎Campak.

307
00:19:47,895 --> 00:19:49,980
‎Ranma. Lega tak?

308
00:19:50,814 --> 00:19:51,857
‎Helo?

309
00:19:54,818 --> 00:19:57,070
‎Awak lelaki tadi?

310
00:19:57,154 --> 00:19:59,907
‎Ya, inilah yang sebenarnya.

311
00:20:01,074 --> 00:20:02,075
‎Tak mungkin…

312
00:20:02,743 --> 00:20:05,412
‎Ranma sebenarnya lelaki.

313
00:20:08,916 --> 00:20:11,877
‎Sekarang ini, Akane saja yang tinggal.

314
00:20:12,461 --> 00:20:14,796
‎Serang!

315
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:18,759
‎Sudahlah. Jangan asyik kejar perempuan.

316
00:20:18,842 --> 00:20:21,386
‎- Kenapa kau benci sangat lelaki?
‎- Lepaslah.

317
00:20:21,470 --> 00:20:22,930
‎Diamlah!

318
00:20:25,766 --> 00:20:28,185
‎Kenapa saya nak buang masa dengan lelaki?

319
00:20:28,268 --> 00:20:31,396
‎Saya nak keluar dengan perempuan comel!

320
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:32,481
‎Apa?

321
00:20:34,524 --> 00:20:36,985
‎Apa? Tak pernah tengok lelaki bogel?

322
00:20:37,486 --> 00:20:39,196
‎Begitu.

323
00:20:39,279 --> 00:20:41,657
‎Penat-penat aku buat semua itu.

324
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:44,785
‎Rupa-rupaya kau lelaki.

325
00:20:46,995 --> 00:20:48,872
‎- Sekolah lelaki?
‎- Ya.

326
00:20:49,456 --> 00:20:52,960
‎Aku tak cakap
‎yang sekolah lama aku itu sekolah lelaki?

327
00:20:53,043 --> 00:20:54,461
‎Aku baru tahu.

328
00:20:54,544 --> 00:20:56,463
‎Rasa tertipu pula.

329
00:20:57,005 --> 00:20:59,132
‎Tertipu? Jangan rasa begitu.

330
00:20:59,216 --> 00:21:01,885
‎Saya cuma budak lelaki
‎yang suka pakai baju perempuan.

331
00:21:01,969 --> 00:21:05,389
‎Kamu tak tanya.
‎Aku ingat semua orang dah tahu.

332
00:21:05,472 --> 00:21:07,391
‎Macam mana nak tahu?

333
00:21:07,474 --> 00:21:09,351
‎Patutnya kau cakap dari awal.

334
00:21:09,434 --> 00:21:10,852
‎Janganlah marah.

335
00:21:10,936 --> 00:21:13,355
‎Bukankah hobi kita sama?

336
00:21:13,438 --> 00:21:16,066
<i>‎Bukankah hobi kita sama?</i>

337
00:21:16,733 --> 00:21:20,862
‎Tak samalah! Itu bukan hobi aku!

338
00:21:28,662 --> 00:21:31,999
‎Serang!

339
00:22:57,000 --> 00:23:02,005
{\an8}‎Terjemahan sari kata oleh Aizat Bahri

